  "description": "Jiho, the vocalist of the indie band \"Will,\" had lived his life proving his uniqueness through his songs.\nHowever, after a surgery and improper vocal care, he can no longer sing.\n\n\"I'm not special anymore!\"\n\nOn the day he decided to let go of everything, he encounters a mysterious being in his dreams.\n\n\"Who… are you?\"\n\n\"Me?\"\n\nThe figure's eyes sparkle with curiosity, as if discovering an intriguing new toy.\n\n\"I'm Sun Wukong. Others call me the Great Sage Equal to Heaven. And...\"\n\nThe corners of his lips curl into a sly smile.\n\n\"I am your past life.\"\n\n[Original Novel](https://page.kakao.com/content/48609317)\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[KakaoPage](https://page.kakao.com/content/49275665), [Daum](https://webtoon.kakao.com/content/%EC%8B%A0%EC%84%B8%EA%B8%B0%EC%A0%84/2840)",
